# Templates

- Register every `ResourceKind` renderer in `templates/index.tsx`.
- Prefer a real template over `PlaceholderTemplate`. Keep placeholders only for not-yet-built kinds.
- Server templates fetch with SDK helpers (`getProduct`, `getCatalogProducts`, `getProductGroupWithProducts`, `getCart`).
- Pass `locale` and numeric `id`. Use `searchParams` for catalog sort/pagination.
- Puck published config wins when present (`getTemplateConfig` / `getPageConfig`). Templates are the fallback.
- Checkout: link to `checkoutUrl`. Do not implement payment UI.
- Reuse `components/product/*` and `components/cart/*` instead of new one-off markup.
